Description: Open-source, independent parametric 3D CAD
 Sketches with a constraint solver, a parametric feature timeline,
 components and joints, sheet metal; STEP, IGES, 3MF, STL and OBJ.
 Includes solidcraft-cli, a headless command runner and MCP server for AI
 agents.
 .
 This package repackages the upstream prebuilt Linux release binaries. It is not
 compiled from source by Launchpad.
